# Actual max4 words reaching the proposed image sets

A decreasing-depth forest on the first image set gives words carrying 0 to
all its points. Four explicit words fixing 0 give a second forest starting
at 1. Every edge and every zero-fixing equation is checked on the actual
ATLAS generator tables; induction constructs elements of the unchanged max4.
Neither orbit completeness nor a group order is assumed.

Source: the preserved ATLAS max4 program, with untrusted forest discovery in
`Max4Normalizers/source/geometry.py`. The point convention is the inverse
left action documented in `SylowOvergroups.Definitions`.
-/

